flowchart LR
    A[Customer request] --> B[Extract intent and reason]
    B --> C[Retrieve order]
    C --> D[Retrieve applicable policy]
    D --> E[Evaluate eligibility]
    E --> F{Eligible?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Choose refund or replacement]
    F -->|No| H[Reject or route to warranty]
    G --> I[Generate customer response]
    H --> I